OL,5,G1100 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FIn Derbyshire, the cops are forced
OL,7,     Fto make a dramatic stop during a
OL,8,     Frace to stop burglars. And some
OL,9,     Fstolen property turns up in an
OL,10,     Funusual place.
OL,11,G1200 Traffic Cops
OL,12,     FJim responds to an urgent call for
OL,13,     Fbackup from a colleague, who is
OL,14,     Fsurrounded by an angry mob
OL,15,     Ffollowing a report of an agressive
OL,16,     Fyoung man's dangerous driving.
OL,17,G1300 Traffic Cops
