OL,5,G2100 999: Killer On The Line
OL,6,     FIn 2011, Julie Dixon murdered her
OL,7,     Ffiance David Twigg by locking him
OL,8,     Fin a cupboard and starting a fire,
OL,9,     Fbut told the police that it was
OL,10,     Fpart of a suicide pact.
OL,11,G2200 999: Critical Condition
OL,12,     FThe work of a major hospital
OL,13,     Ftrauma unit. Ian is rushed in
OL,14,     Fafter suffering a cardiac arrest.
OL,15,     FKen is flown to the hospital by
OL,16,     Fhelicopter after falling from a
OL,17,     Froof onto a skip.
